('ankheg','Ankheg','Ankheg','3','Large','Magical Beast','Always neutral','3d10+12 (28 hp)',28,'+0','30 ft. (6 squares), burrow 20 ft.','18 (–1 size, +9 natural), touch 9, flat-footed 18','+3/+12','Bite +7 melee (2d6+7 plus 1d4 acid)','10 ft./5 ft.','+6','+3','+2',21,10,17,1,13,6,'Climb +8, Listen +6, Spot +3','Alertness, Toughness','{"special_attacks":"Improved grab, spit acid","special_qualities":"Darkvision 60 ft., low-light vision, tremorsense 60 ft."}'::jsonb,'The ankheg is a burrowing monster with a taste for fresh meat. An ankheg has six legs, and some specimens are yellow rather than brown. It is about 10 feet long and weighs about 800 pounds.

An ankheg burrows with legs and mandibles. A burrowing ankheg usually does not make a usable tunnel, but can construct a tunnel; it burrows at half speed when it does so. It often digs a winding tunnel up to 40 feet below the surface in the rich soil of forests or farmlands. The tunnel is 5 feet tall and wide, and from 60 to 150 feet long (\[1d10 + 5\] x 10).','{"full_attack":"Bite +7 melee (2d6+7 plus 1d4 acid)","environment":"Warm plains","organization":"Solitary or cluster (2–4)","treasure":"None","advancement":"4 HD (Large); 5–9 HD (Huge)","level_adjustment":"—","statblock":{"hit_dice":"3d10+12 (28 hp)","hit_points":28,"base_attack_grapple":"+3/+12","attack":"Bite +7 melee (2d6+7 plus 1d4 acid)","full_attack":"Bite +7 melee (2d6+7 plus 1d4 acid)","space_reach":"10 ft./5 ft.","saves":"Fort +6, Ref +3, Will +2","abilities":{"str":"21","dex":"10","con":"17","int":"1","wis":"13","cha":"6"},"skills":"Climb +8, Listen +6, Spot +3","feats":"Alertness, Toughness","special_attacks":"Improved grab, spit acid","special_qualities":"Darkvision 60 ft., low-light vision, tremorsense 60 ft."},"source_file":"monsters-intro-a.md","source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md"}'::jsonb,'https://olimot.github.io/srd-v3.5/monsters/monsters-intro-a.html',true),
('aranea','Aranea','Aranea','4','Medium','Magical Beast (Shapechanger)','Usually neutral','3d10+6 (22 hp)',22,'+6','50 ft. (10 squares), climb 25 ft.','13 (+2 Dex, +1 natural), touch 12, flat-footed 11','+3/+3','Bite +5 melee (1d6 plus poison) or web +5 ranged','5 ft./5 ft.','+5','+5','+4',11,15,14,14,13,14,'Climb +14, Concentration +8, Escape Artist +5, Jump +13, Listen +6, Spot +6','Improved Initiative, Iron WillB, Weapon Finesse','{"special_attacks":"Poison, spells, web","special_qualities":"Change shape, darkvision 60 ft., low-light vision"}'::jsonb,'An aranea is an intelligent, shapechanging spider with sorcerous powers. In its natural form, an aranea resembles a big spider, with a humpbacked body a little bigger than a human torso. It has fanged mandibles like a normal spider. Two small arms, each about 2 feet long, lie below the mandibles. Each arm has a hand with four many-jointed fingers and a double-jointed thumb.

An aranea weighs about 150 pounds. The hump on its back houses its brain.

Araneas speak Common and Sylvan.','{"full_attack":"Bite +5 melee (1d6 plus poison) or web +5 ranged","environment":"Temperate forests","organization":"Solitary or colony (3–6)","treasure":"Standard coins; double goods; standard items","advancement":"By character class","level_adjustment":"+4","statblock":{"hit_dice":"3d10+6 (22 hp)","hit_points":22,"base_attack_grapple":"+3/+3","attack":"Bite +5 melee (1d6 plus poison) or web +5 ranged","full_attack":"Bite +5 melee (1d6 plus poison) or web +5 ranged","space_reach":"5 ft./5 ft.","saves":"Fort +5, Ref +5, Will +4","abilities":{"str":"11","dex":"15","con":"14","int":"14","wis":"13","cha":"14"},"skills":"Climb +14, Concentration +8, Escape Artist +5, Jump +13, Listen +6, Spot +6","feats":"Improved Initiative, Iron WillB, Weapon Finesse","special_attacks":"Poison, spells, web","special_qualities":"Change shape, darkvision 60 ft., low-light vision"},"source_file":"monsters-intro-a.md","source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md"}'::jsonb,'https://olimot.github.io/srd-v3.5/monsters/monsters-intro-a.html',true),
